        "title": "One Giant Graph Schema",
        "description": "Require every graph to carry the same declarations, dictionaries, summaries, editors, icons, automation, and policy structures.",
        "tradeoffs": "Uniform inspection becomes easier, but ordinary graphs become bloated and graph-family distinctions disappear into optional fields.",
        "definitionKey": "idea-alternative",
